<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>招待费管理</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
      background: #0a1e3d;
      min-height: 100vh;
      width: 100vw;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* ---- 背景光晕 ---- */
    .bg-glow {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(120px);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .bg-glow--1 {
      width: 80vw;
      height: 80vh;
      top: -15%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }

    .bg-glow--2 {
      width: 60vw;
      height: 60vh;
      bottom: -20%;
      left: -5%;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.14) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }

    .bg-glow--3 {
      width: 50vw;
      height: 50vh;
      bottom: -15%;
      right: -5%;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }

    /* ---- 主内容 ---- */
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      padding: 0 clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* ---- 标题 ---- */
    .page-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: clamp(32px, 4vh, 56px);
    }

    .page-title {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 60px);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e8f0fe;
      letter-spacing: clamp(3px, 0.7vw, 10px);
      text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    }

    .page-subtitle {
      font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 20px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #5a8ac4;
      margin-top: 10px;
      letter-spacing: clamp(1px, 0.4vw, 4px);
    }

    /* ---- 卡片容器 ---- */
    .cards {
      display: flex;
      gap: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 48px);
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: stretch;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1100px;
    }

    /* ---- 卡片 ---- */
    .card {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 300px;
      background: linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 100%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      border-radius: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 28px);
      padding: clamp(44px, 5vh, 64px) clamp(32px, 4vw, 52px);
      text-align: center;
      transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                  box-shadow 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                  border-color 0.35s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6, #60a5fa);
      border-radius: 28px 28px 0 0;
    }

    .card::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12),
                  0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .card:hover::after {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* ---- 图标 ---- */
    .icon-wrapper {
      width: clamp(72px, 9vw, 100px);
      height: clamp(72px, 9vw, 100px);
      margin-bottom: clamp(20px, 3vh, 32px);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22) 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.10) 100%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover .icon-wrapper {
      transform: scale(1.06);
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.55);
    }

    .icon-wrapper svg {
      width: clamp(34px, 4vw, 46px);
      height: clamp(34px, 4vw, 46px);
      stroke: #60a5fa;
      stroke-width: 1.6;
    }

    /* ---- 卡片文字 ---- */
    .card-title {
      font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 30px);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #e0ecff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: clamp(1px, 0.3vw, 3px);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .card-desc {
      font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 18px);
      color: #7baae0;
      margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 3.5vh, 40px);
      line-height: 1.7;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* ---- 按钮 ---- */
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: clamp(14px, 2.2vh, 18px) clamp(40px, 5vw, 56px);
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #2563eb 50%, #3b82f6 100%);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 50px;
      cursor: pointer;
      letter-spacing: clamp(1px, 0.3vw, 3px);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35),
                  inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      text-decoration: none;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e40af 0%, #1d4ed8 50%, #2563eb 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 36px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5),
                  inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn:active {
      transform: translateY(0);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
    }

    /* ---- 响应式 ---- */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .cards {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
        max-width: 400px;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .card {
        padding: clamp(36px, 7vw, 52px) clamp(28px, 6vw, 36px);
      }

      .bg-glow {
        opacity: 0.35;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-glow bg-glow--1"></div>
  <div class="bg-glow bg-glow--2"></div>
  <div class="bg-glow bg-glow--3"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">招待费管理</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">智能审核 · 精准管控 · 高效便捷</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="11" x2="12" y2="17"/>
            <line x1="9" y1="14" x2="15" y2="14"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="card-title">录入招待费</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">快速校验每一次商务接待</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">立即录入</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            <polyline points="9 15 11 17 15 13"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="card-title">监查招待费</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">严谨审核每一笔招待支出</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">立即审核</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
